        "description": "This is the current Ephtal, who has been reincarnated twice. He has set his sights on the path of magic and is aiming to enroll in a magic academy.\n\nHe retains the memories and magical prowess from his previous life 400 years ago as the Sage and Thunder God Emperor Ephtal; his power is so extraordinary that it would be called a “miracle” by modern standards. However, just as in his past life, he lacks a natural aptitude for magic. Yet he possesses a passion more single-minded than anyone else’s, striving to overcome this handicap through hard work and determination.\n\nWhile kind to others, he detests dishonesty and is a man with a passionate heart, deeply committed to duty and compassion.",
