        "description": "The second son of the Duke of Alcott and Ephtal's older half-brother. \n\nHe looks out for Iria and Ephtal—who are treated poorly due to their lack of aptitude—supporting them by providing living expenses and teaching them academics and swordsmanship. Though he is a pleasant and gentle young man, he is also highly capable, having graduated at the top of his class from the military academy; he currently serves in the military as a magic swordsman. \n\nHe is a kind-hearted older brother who remains grounded in reality while deeply concerned for his younger brother's future.",
